  "22:11": {
    "inputs": {
      "value": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the young woman in <Picture 1>, Tifa Lockhart from Final Fantasy VII: slender athletic build, long dark brown hair falling past her waist and tied at the tips, red eyes, a short black crop top under a white tank top, black suspenders, a short black skirt, red-brown fingerless leather gloves with metal plates, and tall black boots.\n<Subject 2> is the rain-slicked slum alley in <Picture 2>, with rusted corrugated walls, stacked scrap crates, hanging cables and a flickering neon sign, lit by cold blue-green light with orange sparks.\n<Subject 3> is the Shinra soldier in <Picture 3>, a trooper in a full dark-blue armored uniform with a rounded helmet and a glowing green visor, carrying a heavy automatic rifle.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video continues the fight: <Subject 3> gets back up in <Subject 2> behind <Subject 1> and opens fire, she dodges and closes the distance in a fast, heavily cut sequence, disarms him, and ends it with a final blow before a short, calm line.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4], [Shot 5]): fully_preserved - face, long dark hair, outfit, gloves and boots are retained in every shot, including in close-ups and in motion.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 4], [Shot 5]): fully_preserved - rusted walls, scattered crates, cables and flickering neon are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - dark-blue armor, rounded helmet and green visor are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is in a cinematic action-game cutscene style, with high-contrast cold blue-green lighting cut by orange sparks, shallow depth of field, crisp motion and a polished 3D-render look. It continues directly from the previous clip, in the same alley, with the same lighting and the same screen direction. The sequence is cut rapidly, each shot lasting about one to two seconds, with hard cuts.\n[Shot 1] A medium close-up continues the previous moment: <Subject 1> faces the camera, one gloved fist still raised, her teasing smile fading as her eyes flick past the lens. Behind her, out of focus, <Subject 3> pushes himself up from the scattered crates of <Subject 2> and shoulders his rifle.\n[Shot 2] At 00:01.200, a wide low-angle shot: <Subject 3> fires a burst down the alley, muzzle flashes lighting the rain, as <Subject 1> sprints diagonally toward him and slides under the line of fire, sparks flying off the wet ground.\n[Shot 3] At 00:02.500, a tight shot on the hands: <Subject 1> catches the barrel of the rifle with her left glove and wrenches it aside, the weapon spinning out of the grip of <Subject 3> and clattering away.\n[Shot 4] At 00:03.800, a fast side shot: <Subject 1> plants her foot and delivers a hard straight punch to the chest of <Subject 3>, followed at once by a spinning back-fist that throws him against the rusted wall, which dents with a metallic boom.\n[Shot 5] At 00:05.500, a low static shot: <Subject 3> slides down the wall, motionless, while <Subject 1> stands over him in the rain, shakes out her gloved hand, and glances toward the camera with a calm, satisfied smile. An off-screen voice (S1), a young woman's voice, calm, bright and slightly amused, native French speaker, speaking at a relaxed pace, says, <d>[French] Cette fois, c'est fini.</d>\n\noverall_soundscape:\nHeavy rain and the buzz of the flickering neon throughout, a burst of automatic rifle fire in Shot 2, the clang of the rifle on stone in Shot 3, sharp impacts synchronized with each cut, and the boom of the wall in Shot 4.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nThe driving orchestral-rock battle theme resumes at the start of Shot 2 and peaks on the blow of Shot 4, then drops to a quiet low string note under the final line in Shot 5."
    },
